WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:04.460
"Soon... I will be consumed...

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:08.160
by them, by the Dark"

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.040
"Thou art strong human,

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.900
surely thine kind are more than pure Dark"

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:23.660
Even in his last moments, Artorias thought so.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.900
"I beg of thee, the spread of the Abyss...

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.600
i-it..

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.260
must be stopped"

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:36.800
The Furtive Pygmy was the first human, it claimed the Dark Soul and waited for the fire to subside.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:41.120
For while the other souls grew weaker, the Dark Soul grew stronger.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:45.760
The Lord Souls of Light and Dark seem to be in counter balance to one another.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:52.500
While Gwyn fathered the Age of Fire and set up his kingdom, the Pygmy shattered the Dark Soul and fathered Humanity.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:56.260
This mysterious black sprite was the powerful life force of humans.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.040
Driving them to love, hate, create and destroy.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:04.160
The most pure hearted humans were able to create more Humanity within themselves.

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.580
The Dark Soul is unique, in that it can grow and spread through humans.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.680
By the time the Furtive Pygmy was killed. It was already too late.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.960
The Dark Soul had already been split.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:18.020
And it continue to split and grow like disease.

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:22.020
And as the Darkness grew, the Flames did fade.

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.500
And Gwyn's kingdom began to fall.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:30.220
With the fading Flame came the rising Dark and those who would see it grow stronger.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.580
The dragons and the giants were not the only things in the Age of Ancients.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:39.240
From the stone dragons came drakes, hydras and primordial serpents.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.980
You have to wonder at how much influence the serpents have had.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:48.000
Because all throughout the ages, the serpents have always achieved their desires at the expense of others.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:52.980
We know of one serpent, Kaathe who hides in the shadows to see the shadows grow.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:57.440
It was the manipulations of such a serpent, that let to an upturned grave

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:59.260
and the doom of Oolacile.

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:04.940
"Believe it or not…Oolacile has brought the Abyss upon itself.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.760
Fooled by that toothy serpent.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:11.160
They upturned the grave of primeval man,

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:13.900
and incited his ornery wrath.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.340
What could they have been thinking?"

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:21.000
Manus, the Father of the Abyss, primeval human, and once the Furtive Pygmy

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.800
unleashed the wrath of the Dark upon Oolacile,

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:27.100
corrupting and transforming its denizens into monsters.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.700
"Knight Artorias came to stop this,

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:34.300
but such a hero has nary a murmur of Dark.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.620
Without doubt he will be swallowed by the Abyss,

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.440
overcome by its utter blackness...

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:44.140
Indeed, the Abyss may be unstoppable..."

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.560
And Artorias was slain.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:58.960
But a hero from a time distant yet near killed the primeval human in his name.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.740
And ended its rampage.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.320
But Kaathe simply moved on to his next target.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:10.180
Gwyn split his own soul and handed it to the four kings who ruled over the New Londo.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.480
It was the reward for their foresight.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.700
But the kings only wanted more power.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:20.800
"Long ago, the Four Kings were powerful men.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:24.840
Only, their hearts were weak.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:30.680
When an evil serpent dangled the art of Lifedrain before them

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:32.800
they were unable to resist,

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.800
and became pawns of evil."

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.220
Gwyn had already seen what happened in Oolacile.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.540
The spread of the Abyss had to be contained wherever it was found.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:47.840
He flooded New Londo in an attempt to seal the Darkness and the kings.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.120
It was around this time that the other gods started to panic.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:55.140
The goddesses Fina and Velka had already been forcibly exiled by Seath.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.940
And Gwyn's own daughter Gwynevere was to follow.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:02.200
She fled with the Flame god Flann and abandoned her father.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.520
Meanwhile, the Witch of Izalith was working on a plan.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:11.020
She was attempting to duplicate the First Flame using her own magic and her Lord Soul.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.100
Perhaps this could fight off the gathering Dark.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.080
But this plan did not work.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:21.360
In fact it backfired engulfing the Witch, her sisters and the city of Izalith.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.860
Her Soul of Life became twisted,

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:26.600
creating malformed demonic chaotic life.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:29.620
And the world showed first demons.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.760
The silver knights of Gwyn still remain from the war against the dragons,

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:36.620
and they were ordered to fight against the chaos demons.

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:40.980
Despite the bravery of the knights, they were repelled by the Bed of Chaos.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:45.940
The silver knights retreated to Gwyn with armor blackened and charred from their journey to Izalith.

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.680
They had failed.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:50.320
Gwyn's downfall is absolute.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.980
He has lost his kingdom, his knights, his wife, children and friends.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.700
For the stronger the Light, the thicker the shadows fall.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.780
There are no happy endings in Lordran.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:03.740
Even if you do no wrong, tragedy finds you.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.980
Maybe you are searching for the light in a dark place.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.680
Maybe you are fighting to keep your sister alive.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.820
Whether you adventuring for the sake of adventure.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.900
Or risking your life for your Lord.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.600
It will do no good.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.780
But despite futility we do these things anyway.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:25.260
By fighting against the inevitable we carve meaning from meaninglessness.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.760
Gwyn travels to the Kiln with his remaining knights

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.840
and sacrifices himself as fuel for the First Flame,

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:37.180
just so it can burn a little longer for the living.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.640
The Dark will eventually overcome the fading Flame.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.680
But not without a fight.

